-- title:
--   Valuation shells of the twisted centraliser all have equal measure
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ and $L$ be number fields with $L$ a $K$-algebra of degree $\operatorname{finrank}_K L = 2$, let $\sigma$ be a $K$-algebra automorphism of $L$ such that every $K$-algebra automorphism of $L$ lies in the subgroup generated by the integer powers of $\sigma$, let $v$ be a height-one prime of $\mathcal{O}_K$ with adic completion $K_v$, let $c \in K_v^\times$, and let $\delta \in \mathrm{GL}_2(L \otimes_K K_v)$ be such that [`AutomorphicForm.IsNormOf`](def/AutomorphicForm_TwistedOrbital.html#L217) holds for the scalar matrix with entry $c$ and for $\delta$, i.e. there is $y$ conjugating `normString K L (v.adicCompletion K) σ δ` into the image of that scalar matrix under the base change $\mathrm{GL}_2(K_v) \to \mathrm{GL}_2(L \otimes_K K_v)$. Consider the $\sigma$-twisted centraliser $T = \{t : t\,\delta\,\sigma(t)^{-1} = \delta\}$, a subgroup of $\mathrm{GL}_2(L \otimes_K K_v)$, where $\sigma$ acts entrywise through $\sigma \otimes \mathrm{id}$, equipped with the Borel $\sigma$-algebra of its topology. Let $\mu$ be a left-invariant measure on $T$ and $k \in \mathbb{Z}$. Then the $\mu$-measure of the set of $t \in T$ with $\det t = 1 \otimes s$ for some $s \in K_v^\times$ of valuation $\exp(-k)$ equals the $\mu$-measure of the set of $t \in T$ with $\det t = 1 \otimes s$ for some $s \in K_v^\times$ of valuation $1$.
--
--   The sets in question are the shells of the twisted centraliser on which the determinant comes from $K_v^\times$ with prescribed valuation; the statement says that all these shells have the same measure, the shell of valuation $0$ being the subgroup of elements of unit reduced norm. It is used in the computation of the local integral over the twisted centraliser at a place where the associated quaternion algebra is ramified, namely in [`AutomorphicForm.lintegral_iUnion_detShell_twistedCentralizer_eq_mul_inv_sub_one_mul_inv_one_sub_of_not_isSigmaConjugate_scalar_of_finrank_eq_two`](thm.html#AutomorphicForm.lintegral_iUnion_detShell_twistedCentralizer_eq_mul_inv_sub_one_mul_inv_one_sub_of_not_isSigmaConjugate_scalar_of_finrank_eq_two).
